
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Kiem tra API
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach san pham
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### 3. Lay san pham ID 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### 4. San pham khong ton tai
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/999

### 5. ID khong hop le
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/abc

### 6. Them san pham hop le
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "San pham tu requests.http",
  "description": "Kiem tra POST",
  "price": 150000
}

### 7. Gia am - mong doi 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "San pham loi",
  "description": "Gia am",
  "price": -100
}

### 8. Thieu Content-Type - mong doi 415
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products

{
  "name": "San pham thieu Content Type",
  "description": "Test 415",
